{"id": "t111-001", "text": "Layla's picking up the new puppy on 14 Nov, a cockapoo called Biscuit. She's taking the whole week off work afterwards to settle him in.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Layla", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "picking up the new puppy", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "14 Nov", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "cockapoo called Biscuit", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "week off work", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "afterwards", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t111-002", "text": "remind me to text Vanessa the morning of her appraisal, she's dreading it. it's thurs 9am with her new manager", "spans": [{"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "text Vanessa", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "message", "timing": "on"}, {"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Vanessa", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the morning of", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "appraisal", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "dreading it", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "thurs 9am", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "manager", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t111-003", "text": "Jen said her cat Pickle has kidney problems, vet wants bloods redone 3rd of December. she's pretty upset about it", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jen", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "cat Pickle", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "kidney problems", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "vet", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "bloods redone", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "3rd of December", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "pretty upset", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t111-004", "text": "Rin starts at Deloitte on 6/01. Ask her how the first week went the friday after. She's a bit nervous because it's a big step up from the small firm, and her manager there, a guy called Lars, apparently has a reputation. Her partner Jen is throwing her a little send-off at theirs on the 3rd", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Rin", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "starts at Deloitte", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "6/01", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Ask her how the first week went", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the friday after", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "a bit nervous", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "manager", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Lars", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "partner", "owner": "p3", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jen", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "send-off at theirs", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 3rd", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t111-005", "text": "so Yosef and his wife Mai are doing a joint thing for their kids' birthdays, both on the 22nd, soft play then pizza. his mum's flying in from Haifa the day before to help. I said I'd bring the cake, I'm doing a caterpillar one", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Yosef", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "wife", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mai", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "joint thing", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "kids", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "birthdays", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 22nd", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flying in from Haifa", "owner": "r2", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the day before", "anchor": "e3"}]}
{"id": "t111-006", "text": "Antoine got promoted to team lead!! need to sort a card from all of us before Friday", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Antoine", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "promoted to team lead", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "sort a card from all of us", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "before Friday", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t111-007", "text": "Andile's dog Rolo turns 1 on 9 March. she's literally throwing him a party lol, dog-friendly cake and everything", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Andile", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "dog Rolo", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "turns 1", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "9 March", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "party", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "ask_outcome"}]}
{"id": "t111-008", "text": "call w Alice re the Gonzalez account. client wants the deck by 28/10, she's presenting it to their board on the 30th. offered to proof it the day before", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Alice", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "by 28/10"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "presenting it to their board", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 30th", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the day before"}]}
{"id": "t111-009", "text": "Kiri - vegetarian, hates coriander, into bouldering. sister Zoe lives in Leeds", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kiri", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "vegetarian", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "diet"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "hates coriander", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "dislike"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "bouldering", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "sister", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Zoe", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "lives in Leeds", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "home"}]}
