{"id": "t111-011", "text": "Noah's nan passed away on Sunday. Funeral is the 4th of November. I should send flowers to his mum's house the day before", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Noah", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "nan", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "passed away", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Sunday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Funeral", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 4th of November", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send flowers to his mum's house", "owner": "r2", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the day before", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t111-012", "text": "Just got off the phone with Mohammed. His daughter Amara got into Manchester for medicine, they're over the moon. She starts in September. He kept saying she'd worked so hard for it. Must get her something small to celebrate, maybe a nice stethoscope or a voucher for the uni bookshop", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mohammed", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "daughter", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Amara", "pronoun": "she", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "got into Manchester for medicine", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "school", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "over the moon", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "starts", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "school", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in September", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "get her something small to celebrate", "owner": "p2", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "after"}]}
{"id": "t111-013", "text": "Sam's hamster died. kids are gutted apparently", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sam", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "hamster", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "died", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "kids", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "gutted", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t111-014", "text": "zainab mentioned her boss is retiring end of jan and she might go for his role. interviews mid feb she thinks", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "zainab", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "boss", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "retiring", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "end of jan", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "might go for his role", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "interviews", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "interview", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "mid feb", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t111-015", "text": "Yasmin's brother Eli is getting married 12 April in Lisbon. she's maid of honour and stressing about the speech. hen do is the weekend before. Eli's fiancee Keisha wants something low-key, so they're thinking spa day not Magaluf. Yasmin asked if I'd read the speech over, said I would. Their mum is making the dress herself which is apparently causing drama", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Yasmin", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "brother", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Eli", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "getting married", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "wedding", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "12 April", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "maid of honour", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "stressing", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "speech", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "hen do", "owner": "p3", "event_type": "wedding", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the weekend before", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "p2b", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Eli", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "fiancee", "owner": "p3", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Keisha", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "p1b", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Yasmin", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}]}
