{"id": "t111-017", "text": "Wei's new kitten is called Dumpling. she sent like 40 photos. her flatmate Lucy is allergic so that's going well", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Wei", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "new kitten", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "flatmate", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Lucy", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "allergic", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "health"}]}
{"id": "t111-018", "text": "Ivan has his driving test on 17/11, third attempt, really nervous. Text him good luck that morning and then ring him afterwards to see how it went. His instructor reckons he's ready, it's just nerves, he froze at the roundabout last time. His girlfriend Zoe is lending him her car for it", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ivan", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "driving test", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "wish_luck"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "17/11", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "nervous", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Text him good luck", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "wish_luck", "timing": "on"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "that morning", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ring him", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "afterwards", "anchor": "a2"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "instructor", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "girlfriend", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Zoe", "pronoun": "she", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t111-019", "text": "met Karim's partner Theo at the pub, really nice, works in theatre lighting. they've just bought a place in Walthamstow, moving in early December", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Karim", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "partner", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Theo", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "works in theatre lighting", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "bought a place in Walthamstow", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "home"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moving in", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "early December", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t111-020", "text": "Anika's going on maternity leave from 20 Dec. baby's due mid January. Keisha's organising a collection, don't forget to chip in", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Anika", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "maternity leave", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "from 20 Dec", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "due", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "mid January", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Keisha", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "chip in", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "before"}]}
{"id": "t111-021", "text": "Lars from the client side mentioned his son Mateo has a cello recital Saturday. Seemed proud. Kid's only 9. Lars said afterwards there's a dinner with the Santos team on 2nd of Dec and he'd like me there too. Need to email Lars the agenda by Monday, and mention the recital, he'll like that", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Lars", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "from the client side", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "son", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mateo", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "cello recital", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "Seemed proud", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "only 9", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "p1b", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Lars", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "afterwards"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "dinner with the Santos team", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "2nd of Dec", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "email Lars the agenda", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "message", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "p1c", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Lars", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "by Monday", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "mention the recital", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}]}
{"id": "t111-022", "text": "Ellie's spaniel Ruby had her op yesterday, a lump removed from her leg. stitches out ten days after. Ellie hasn't slept properly, she's been so worried. check in with her at the weekend", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ellie", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "spaniel Ruby", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "op", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "yesterday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "stitches out", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "ten days after", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p1b", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ellie", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "worried", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "check in with her", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the weekend", "anchor": "a1"}]}
