{"id": "t111-052", "text": "Ciara's cat Mango went missing on Tuesday, she's put posters up all round Clapham. Share her post on the street group", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ciara", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "cat Mango", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "went missing", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Tuesday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Share her post on the street group", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "send", "timing": "after"}]}
{"id": "t111-053", "text": "chat with Layla and Vanessa about the christmas do. it was supposed to be at the bowling place on the 12th but that's off now, venue double booked. Vanessa's looking at the 13th instead", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Layla", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Vanessa", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "christmas do", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 12th"}, {"id": "p2b", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Vanessa", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 13th", "anchor": "e1"}]}
