{"id": "t111-056", "text": "Antoine's mum Amara Adeyemi turns 60 on the 2nd of March, surprise party at their house. he's asked everyone to keep it quiet. I'm bringing the jollof", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Antoine", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "mum", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Amara Adeyemi", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "turns 60", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 2nd of March", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "surprise party at their house", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}]}
{"id": "t111-057", "text": "So Andile told me at work today that her puppy, Rolo's little brother Bean, is coming home on 8 Feb. She's already bought him a bed, a crate, three harnesses. She asked if I'd come round the week after and help with the toilet training lol. Also she's got her performance review on the 6th, which she's weirdly calm about", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Andile", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "today"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "puppy, Rolo's little brother Bean", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "coming home", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "8 Feb", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the week after"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "performance review", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 6th", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "weirdly calm", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
